menu "LASR Web Camera (experimental)"
  config LASR_WEB_ENABLED
    bool "Enable ESP32-C6 Wi-Fi hotspot and camera MJPEG server"
    default n
    help
      Experimental only. Requires a compatible ESP-Hosted slave image
      on the Tab5 ESP32-C6 and an independently verified flash layout.
      Do not flash if application size exceeds installed partition.
endmenu
